---
title: AdviseCare - State Machine - Take-On Request
---

stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> pending : advisor asks to take on an unassigned case or an open flag
    pending --> approved : Programme Head approves (case assigned, or case opened from the flag)
    pending --> declined : Programme Head declines with a reason
    pending --> withdrawn : advisor withdraws it
    pending --> cancelled : another request approved, direct assign or open-case, flag dismissed or cleared
    approved --> [*]
    declined --> [*]
    withdrawn --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
